	(text "AD620 minimum total supply is 4.6 V, so it CANNOT run on 3.3 V.\nPath B therefore needs the +5V_AMP rail, and its output must be kept\ninside the ADS1220 input range (O-7). Single-supply use also needs\nAMP_REF biased above ground - value TBD with O-2."
